    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:</i>&nbsp;<i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><b>Manufactured By:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonadan\" title=\"Bonadan\">Bonadan</a> (Planet) </p><p><b>Applicable To:</b> Any Armor that provides an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> </p><p>Although weapons are <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Illegal\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illegal\">Illegal</a> on the crowded world of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonadan\" title=\"Bonadan\">Bonadan</a>, armor crafted from a unique alloy created on the planet is second to none. </p><p><b>Armor:</b> Bonadan-Alloy Armor provides <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a> 2 against Slashing damage, but any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> provided by the Armor is reduced by one (to a minimum of +0). </p>",
